jobs.description:
Would you like to grow within a dynamic international environment where you play a key role in coordinating business activities?


Our client is looking for an Administrative Commercial Assistant who will be responsible for the administrative, logistical, and financial follow-up of commercial operations while acting as a true business partner to the trading team.


Your Responsibilities


Working closely with traders and various internal departments, you will manage and coordinate files from A to Z:


Coordinate administrative processes and ensure accurate contract follow-up;


Organize transportation and oversee logistical operations related to shipments;


Manage the financial follow-up of files, including invoicing, payment processing, hedge monitoring, and period closings;


Maintain daily contact with international clients, suppliers, and business partners;


Support traders by ensuring smooth and efficient handling of commercial dossiers;


Contribute to the continuous improvement of internal processes and collaboration between departments.




You have successful experience in an administrative, commercial, logistics, or customer support role;


You are well-organized, detail-oriented, and able to manage multiple priorities simultaneously;


You enjoy working as part of a team while maintaining a high level of autonomy;


You are solution-oriented and thrive in an international business environment;


You are fluent in English; any additional language is considered a strong asset;


You have an excellent command of Microsoft Office applications, particularly Excel.







Strong service-oriented mindset;


Proactive attitude and sense of initiative;


Ability to anticipate needs and solve problems efficiently;


Resilience and flexibility in managing unexpected situations;


Long-term commitment and willingness to contribute to the company's success.
